Type: project
Title: FFball Prediction Model
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Reproducible research pipeline for weekly fantasy football
    projections. Milestone 1: WR weekly PPR projections benchmarked against
    ESPN's pregame projections with strictly point-in-time features.
